{"seq":6,"slug":"indie-marketing-content-community","title":"独立营销：内容、社区与邮件","stage":"DONE","category":"indie-app-shipping","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-marketing-content-community","rating":{"composite":3.84,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"独立营销-内容-社区与邮件-简介\">独立营销：内容、社区与邮件 简介</h1><p>发布带来的是峰值，持续增长靠的是一个长期运转的营销引擎。本 hub 面向想低成本、可持续地获客的独立开发者，从内容与 SEO（内容营销、为排名而写、程序化与长尾 SEO）讲起，覆盖公开构建与社交（作为持续引擎的 build in public、社交存在、分发渠道组合）、邮件与订阅（建立名单、生命周期邮件、newsletter 作为渠道），以及社区与口碑（嵌入垂直社区、口碑与推荐、可持续的营销系统）。它是「持续的营销引擎」，与定位 hub 的受众优先策略、发布 hub 的一次性峰值互补。贯穿全篇的实操主线是：营销的核心是分发、偏好可复利低维护的渠道、把流量沉淀为你拥有的资产（邮件名单）、真诚地提供价值而非发广告——而一切营销最终建立在一个真正好、值得口碑的产品之上。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"content-and-seo","title":"Content And Seo","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-marketing-content-community/content-and-seo","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"content-marketing-for-indies","title":"独立开发者的内容营销","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-marketing-content-community/content-and-seo/content-marketing-for-indies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"seo-and-write-to-rank","title":"SEO 与为排名而写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-marketing-content-community/content-and-seo/seo-and-write-to-rank"},{"seq":3,"slug":"programmatic-and-long-tail","title":"程序化与长尾 SEO","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-marketing-content-community/content-and-seo/programmatic-and-long-tail"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"build-in-public-and-social","title":"Build In Public And Social","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-marketing-content-community/build-in-public-and-social","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"build-in-public-engine","title":"公开构建作为持续引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/indie-marketing-content-community/build-in-public-and-social/build-in-public-engine"},{"seq":2,"slug"